error[jexpr::parser::array::empty]: Empty array not allowed
  ╭▸ 
1 │ []
  │ ━━ empty arrays are not allowed as expressions
  │
  ├ help: add a function expression as the first element, or use `{"#list": []}` for an empty list
  ╰ note: in J-Expr, bare arrays represent function calls whose first element is the callee:
          - `["get", "user"]` calls `get` with `user`
          - `{"#list": []}` constructs an empty list
          - `{"#tuple": []}` constructs an empty tuple
